Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So it all comes down\Nto this. If you manage
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.25,0:01:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to defeat me you're\Nfree to go and tell your
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.77,0:01:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh friend your\Nnewfound secret but lose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.81,0:01:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and the only place you'll\Ngo is the shadow realm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but i don't even have\Na deck or a dual disc
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you were saying it's been\Na while since you and i
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,have faced off in a good\Nold-fashioned duel hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, this time you don't have\Nthat alter ego of yours to bail you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.57,0:01:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you shouldn't go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That is right, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not till we know where Tristan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.93,0:01:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Fukura!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.41,0:01:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend thought he was tough,\Nbut actually he was quite weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.33,0:01:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So weak in that, that I was\Nable to take over his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:01:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everything makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, where is he now, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We want our friend back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.15,0:02:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever want to see him again,\NI'd suggest we get this game underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.41,0:02:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.05,0:02:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, my friends! Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.21,0:02:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kareem!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis! Hurry! Not yet! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Age of Darkness has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought Diabao was\Nfrightening, then just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.73,0:02:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord of Darkness is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.63,0:03:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Almighty Zork!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The very being responsible\Nfor creating the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Realm has crossed\Nover into our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.65,0:03:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the prophecy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.05,0:03:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,there is only one person who can\Ndefeat Sork, the Chosen Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, my most powerful game\Npiece has joined our competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to wipe your kingdom off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork, reduce this land to rubble and\Nenvelop Egypt in eternal darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The same force that\Nthreatened your homeland
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 years ago has\Nreturned to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ages ago, I created the realm of shadows,\Nwhere I have resided for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have been released,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,our worlds will converge, and you\Nwill be swallowed by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, mortals!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,According to legend,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,even Hassan cannot defend us from\Nthe evil rage of the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:04:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the kingdom while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hassan, our protector of pharaohs,\Nis no match for the Lord of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have failed you, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you're unaware, the Dark\NOne has already begun its rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But no need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you remain down here,\NZork is unable to harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that doesn't mean\Nyou're safe from my rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock this guy's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to help the pharaoh take down\NZork, then I have to take down Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.57,0:05:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose this duel, the Pharaoh will\Nnever figure out what his real name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So it all comes down to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.33,0:06:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play a monster in\Ndefense mode and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, if that's the best move you\Ncan come up with, then I've already won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I know it's been a while, so\Nlet me remind you how the game is played.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my doom-caliber knight and say\Nfarewell to your face-down monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You triggered my monster's special effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Marshmellon, and when\Nhe's attacked, you lose 1,000 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And as an added bonus, he\Ncan't be destroyed in battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a monster or a dessert topping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face\Ndown and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.45,0:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiria, allow me to envision\NZork through your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He is nearing the kingdom, Shaddaa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.05,0:07:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our duty to protect the\Npeople of Egypt at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you believe me, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For all I know, this whole\Nthing is a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisara, rest here, and\NI shall return for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try telling that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Some guy who looks like me lost his\Ngirlfriend so I should feel bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.47,0:07:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.75,0:08:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.53,0:08:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I feared has come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.85,0:08:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil force is threatening our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We must act quickly or\Nall hope will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone into the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.65,0:08:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.61,0:08:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They've already prepared for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Man your stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Simon! Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:08:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:08:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could say the same for my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he still under Bakura's control?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's in the Shadow Realm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I promise he'll return Let's hope Now\Non to the issue at hand Zork is... Farrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're much too weak for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,my king Please allow me\Nto lead these soldiers So
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That I may reclaim my honor.\NIt's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you Lead them Right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zork!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.83,0:09:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men. Ready yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature is not to\Nstep one foot in our city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.03,0:09:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the name of the\Npharaoh, we shall prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.37,0:10:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll place this face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,then i'll summon silent\Nswordsman in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.41,0:10:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,first that marshmallow\Nthing and now this what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of freak deck is\Nyuki playing with Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.19,0:10:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,hopefully not one Bacora picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.59,0:10:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of strategy is\Nthis Pipsqueak planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He just played two weak monsters in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshmallow glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll play him on your night!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the only monster it\Ncan attack is Marshmallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, but that ranch can't be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And my life points are safe, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if he remains in defense\Nmode, which he won't. Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.63,0:11:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,without the Pharaoh controlling your\Nevery move, you don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate negate defense, switching your\Ngelatin mode from defense to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.21,0:11:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that you were saying\Nabout your life points being safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I shall place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.29,0:11:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until you see the reds of his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.89,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:12:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, he is but one\Nbeast against a great army!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But things are just getting interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious, Farrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The events of the past are\Nbeginning to affect the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If the world was\Ndestroyed 5,000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,then the world of today\Nwould cease to exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as Zork covers\Nancient Egypt in darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have completed what\NI began centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This shadow game is the crossroads of\Ntime where the past and the future meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And before it's through,\NI'll have destroyed both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And none of it was possible without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.33,0:12:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You allowed me to reunite\Nwith the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.49,0:13:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he is taking care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the Shadow Realm\Nitself has been unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And the darkness once confined\Nto its borders has been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, we must retreat and\Nregroup our forces. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To the palace men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My chest is blowing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.87,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got bigger problems! How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You spent years trying to save\Nthe world, only to lose now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is far from over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,which means my silent swordsman grows\Nfrom a level zero monster to level one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:14:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So his feeble little friend\Nhas a hidden ability, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with a few extra attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,that scrawny swordsman doesn't stand a\Nchance against my doom-caliber knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for my next move! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.75,0:14:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you've just triggered my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Call of the Earthbound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll use it on your swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that worthless warrior of\Nyours will be forced to engage in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.31,0:14:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a battle with any monster on the\Nplaying field that I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that's not my only trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And this one is also a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So meet Zoma the Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the battle begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But Bakura's new monster is\Nweaker than Yu-Gi Swordsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so why would he force Yu-Gi to attack him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.63,0:15:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When Zoma is attacked, it transforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And this new and improved version of my\Nbeast has the ability to strike back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,attacking your life points directly with\Ntwice the strength of your Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're obviously too\Nstunned, allow me to do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your monster has 1,500 attack points,\Nso you lose 3,000 life points now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi doesn't have\Nthat many points. Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So once Bakura's ghost\Nattacks, Yugi loses the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the Shadow Realm's\Nlovely this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.51,0:15:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my trip's been postponed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.63,0:15:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.97,0:15:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I activated my Turret Jump\NMagic card, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It allowed me to negate the\Nattack of your spirit monster
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,by skipping right over the\Nbattle phase of this turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, that's not all it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My Silent Swordsman just\Njumped to level four!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It has 3,000 points! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Silent Swordsman, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,One more. One more?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,One more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Marshmallow, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy boy. Yeah, you want some\Nmore? Get it, Marshmallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,S'more, man. Never mind, this\Nis probably the toughest duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's ever fought. Usually\Nthe Pharaoh steps in and takes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Over but now Yugi's doing it\Non his own with his own deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, that little twit has no\Nidea what I have in store next!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the Dark One is too powerful\Nfor an army of mere mortals to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.65,0:17:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to face a supernatural\Nthreat is to use a supernatural army!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacred Guardians of the Pharaoh,\Nsummon your strongest shadow creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Geria!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-headed Jackal Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Duos!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your meek warriors are\Npowerless against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Borasword! Battle Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl, it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Start burning and tap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.29,0:18:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feeble attempts at combat insult me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch and learn, mortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.11,0:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has a weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, Pharaoh, I was really\Nhoping for more of a challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,conquering Zork didn't seem to be much of\Na problem for you the first time around,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that you've lost your touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrow, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Farrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.41,0:18:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, you're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.43,0:19:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Another of your mindless minions\Ngoes to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Was your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's of\Nmuch use to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is a bright sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be joining him shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For in a matter of moments, darkness\Nwill blanket the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.75,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Know this, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your actions will not be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat this menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pharaoh friend must be\Nknee-deep in darkness by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only thing that can\Nsave him is locked down here.
